Job Description:
AI QA Engineer job at Strikerz Inc.. Remote.

What are you working on?
• The name of the project(s): UFL
• Genres: Simulation, Sports
• Platforms: Console

For which tasks (responsibilities)?

Our team unites creative professionals who put great effort into developing a quality project for game consoles. If you have experience in game testing or you are just a gamer to the bone, welcome to our int
ernational team, where your skills and creativity will level up, and the opportunity for growth will always be in play!

Responsibilities:
• Functional testing of new AI Assist features, as well as refinements to existing ones;
• Defect validation;
• Analyzing AI and Core game mechanics;
• Developing and updating test documentation aimed at ensuring game quality;
• Quality control of the game project;
• Playtests and feedback on the performance of updated mechanics;
• Working closely with the development team and game designers to analyze the performance of features, localize and reproduce defects;
• Collaborating with QA teams, organizing and working on cross-team feature testing;
• Improving testing strategies and developing functional testing best practices;
• Creating clear and detailed defect reports and communicating with the development team and stakeholders;
• Assist in the development and maintenance of automated test frameworks;
• Keeping up-to-date on new testing tools and strategies.

What kind of professional are we looking for?
• QA Engineer experience of 5 years or more;
• Experience in game dev at the position of Senior QA from 2 years;
• Passion for football and football simulations;
• Knowledge of test design techniques and their applicability;
• Experience in testing across all phases of development and adjusting the testing process according to the needs and current stage of project development;
• Experience with defect and test management systems (Jira, Testrail);
• Proactivity and initiative;
• Systematic approach to problem solving;
• Excellent communication skills and team player mindset;
• Good understanding of the game development process.

Why do we enjoy working here?

Our team unites creative professionals who have great effort to develop a top-quality project for gaming consoles. If you possess experience in game development or are just a gamer to the core, you are welcome to be a part of our international team, where your skills and creativity will be boosted, and the possibility for growth will always be in the game!

What are the conditions and bonuses?
• Competitive salary;
• Medical insurance, sick leaves and social benefits;
• Relocation package;
• Sports compensation;
• Online English classes;
• Referral bonuses;
• Co-working compensation;
• Corporate events.
